  "rationale": "Bud Powell's only Blue Note leader session \u2014 the fifth and final volume of his celebrated 'The Amazing Bud Powell' series. A defining trio statement recorded at the peak of his late-1950s resurgence, featuring Paul Chambers and Art Taylor. Penguin Guide crowns it a core collection title; Rolling Stone Jazz Record Guide and AllMusic rate it 4 stars; DownBeat gives it 4/5. Powell's compositional originality is on full display across nine originals including the well-known 'Cleopatra's Dream' and 'Crossin' the Channel'. Essential for completing Bud Powell's Blue Note arc in the canon (Vols. 1-2 are already included).",
