    "notes": "Single session on December 29, 1958 at Van Gelder Studio, Hackensack (pre-move). Originally released 1959 as Blue Note BLP 4009. Also known as The Amazing Bud Powell, Vol. 5. CD reissue includes alternate take of 'Comin' Up' as bonus track. Rudy Van Gelder is confirmed as recording engineer per Discogs credits ('Recorded By \u2013 Rudy Van Gelder')."
